{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-78","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"If from a straight line there be subtracted a straight line which is incommensurable in square with the whole and which with the whole makes the sum of the squares on them medial, twice the rectangle contained by them medial, and further the squares on them incommensurable with twice the rectangle contained by them, the remainder is irrational; and let it be called that which produces with a medial area a medial whole.","book":10,"number":78,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.78","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.78/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":78,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","contentId":"euclid-10-78","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"853a1cef02ffa52e04125236e524151897749dde4450ae389792015b8354a1e8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-78.statement","euclid-10-78.proof.1","euclid-10-78.construction.1","euclid-10-78.proof.2","euclid-10-78.proof.3","euclid-10-78.proof.4","euclid-10-78.proof.5","euclid-10-78.proof.6","euclid-10-78.proof.7","euclid-10-78.proof.8","euclid-10-78.proof.9","euclid-10-78.proof.10","euclid-10-78.proof.11","euclid-10-78.proof.12","euclid-10-78.conclusion","euclid-10-78.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-78.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"abbb1af62ac78ee2a1a7b161ebb1011139913ba62097d86dd8457b250cab1610","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If from a straight line there be subtracted a straight line which is incommensurable in square with the whole and which with the whole makes the sum of the squares on them medial, twice the rectangle contained by them medial, and further the squares on them incommensurable with twice the rectangle contained by them, the remainder is irrational; and let it be called that which produces with a medial area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从一条直线减去一条直线,即正方形的不可公度整线,加上这条直线,中项无理线段整线的正方形加中项无理线段加矩形的两倍,再加不可公度的正方形加矩形整线,其余的无理加中项无理线段整年的两倍,则称为中项无理线段整年的中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ddc21b64fe651957716a125357064f55a7c50b4ceceacfe299d65f1da8b07fb","citations":["euclid-10-35"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For from the straight line AB let there be subtracted the straight line BC incommensurable in square with AB and fulfilling the given conditions; [[X. 35](/principles/euclid-10-35)] I say that the remainder AC is the irrational straight line called that which produces with a medial area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将直线 AB从正方形的第BC 不可公度直线减去AB,并满足了规定的条件;我说,其余的AC是无理线段,即中项无理线段个区域中项无理线段个区域中项无理线段个整片的无理线段。 [[X. 35](/principles/euclid-10-35)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"511d0e2a1293f188e7729e9e63c6f4efdcef74fd83739505117179da68f4bf00","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a rational straight line DI be set out, to DI let there be applied DE equal to the squares on AB, BC, producing DG as breadth, and let DH equal to twice the rectangle AB, BC be subtracted."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将有理线段 DI改为DI,将DE的DE等于正方形机的AB,将DG的宽度扩大至DG,将DH的宽度减去矩形 AB的两倍,将BC的宽度再减去。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ae2b7a76261ec30b50dd4ed0169ae7bf9ac38a8993a3d1f2bb77d43339f87aa","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the remainder FE is equal to the square on AC, [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)] so that AC is the side of FE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,其余FE等于AC的正方形个,AC是FE的一方。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"172b4bf5148df639936dfb737c47ddbdb6c67e563bd993d383c3ce89418cf203","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the sum of the squares on AB, BC is medial and is equal to DE, therefore DE is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AB比正方形,BC等于中项无理线段,等于DE,DE等于中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"90346117d2378143a9de9fffbc4f9cb411e903566686011bacb4e71170bb4afb","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line DI, producing DG as breadth; therefore DG is rational and incommensurable in length with DI. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到DG宽,因此,DG长为有理,不可公度长为DI。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"70efcaf7449733d88bae1a75d7a731776ed57b3a9da32d55bdeb9d0a544b04e9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since twice the rectangle AB, BC is medial and is equal to DH, therefore DH is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于矩形 AB的两倍,BC是中项无理线段,等于DH,因此DH是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b96e075fc03ba1901f6e6832ff90bb0bdcef5f4da201c4047789539339a7a9e","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line DI, producing DF as breadth; therefore DF is also rational and incommensurable in length with DI. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到DF宽,因此DF长为有理和不可公度长为DI。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c192ec2c4bac928b6746b40276796be101d8fcbe1c1bb1a6e32ba545a36fdcc5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the squares on AB, BC are incommensurable with twice the rectangle AB, BC, therefore DE is also incommensurable with DH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB正方形BC不可公度不可公度矩形矩形矩形ABBC2倍 所以DEABDH不可公度DH"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"95ddb550205e3e689819cf3ab708024260b2ce4d5abfe0be119af909d75b4679","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as DE is to DH, so also is DG to DF; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore DG is incommensurable with DF. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是 DE 与 DH 之比等于 DG 与 DF 之比，因此 DG 与 DF 不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b19cc3ec4e2faa391384fb5c157a4465bdf0be185a8120e4577695e804d022c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore GD, DF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理; 因此,GD,DF是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7e2698ca8d5955807559a90d1c26f33e685fd2399defc37374f63dac3868d7d","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FG is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以FG是截差无理线段 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75d9636d542d41d2f28290901d830f2cd824a4409ddf1448cd8bba48d40c572f","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And FH is rational; but the rectangle contained by a rational straight line and an apotome is irrational, [deduction from [X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)] and its side is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FH是有理,矩形是由有理线段和截差无理线段组成的 其侧面是无理 [deduction from [X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e0e9a22632850dc340af3d31ce70119a8d260d89c905771132fdf1a699e0e5e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AC is the side of FE; therefore AC is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC是FE的一面,AC是无理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"40c23c282c19f5196347ce897cb9aa608846465e08d172bf5dfee3ed1a48e97a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let it be called that which produces with a medial area a medial whole. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以中项无理线段面积生产 整个中项无理线段区域 Q,E,D"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-78.source","contentId":"euclid-10-78","revisionId":"euclid-10-78@raw-853a1cef02ffa52e","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e0577f68be443391a721b606fe070db633d0ac6471fb9c6485dee52ed701b90","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.78/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.78\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-78:euclid-10-35:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-78","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-78.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-35","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.78","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.78/","sourceLabel":"X. 35"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-78:euclid-2-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-78","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-78.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.78","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.78/","sourceLabel":"II. 7"}},{"id":